          <p>Our automated pipeline integrates multiple data sources (tax records, LiDAR, zoning, DOE/RECS archetypes, permits, utility meters) into validated simulation workflows, enabling city-scale energy modeling with unprecedented speed and accuracy.</p>
        </div>
